agents prompt — Display or validate the effective system prompt

USAGE
  agents prompt [options]

OPTIONS
  -check
    	only check that prompt layers exist and assemble cleanly
  -file string
    	optional path to policy or layer file
  -harness string
    	target client harness (claude, antigravity, copilot, codex, pi, opencode)
  -profile string
    	target profile name (e.g. default, personal, work, light) (default "default")
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  Uses the default profile and discovers configuration and prompt layers.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG, CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR, HOME: configuration and prompt discovery.

EXAMPLES
  agents prompt -harness claude -check
